message: "If you use this research software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Ta-Yoshua Lubuimi — Lean 4 Research and Source-Audit Project on the BBMST Square-Free-Moduli Problem"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Lubuimi"
    given-names: "Ta-Yoshua"
abstract: >-
  Research software and staged Lean 4 formalization artifacts related to the
  Erdős–Selfridge problem with square-free moduli, including source audits,
  reproducible workflows, and research documentation. This metadata
  describes the software artifact; it does not claim that the complete BBMST
  square-free theorem has been formalized or that the researcher authored
  the original 2021 theorem.
repository-code: "https://github.com/s4ztz4bnf6-maker/Lubuimi-"
url: "https://github.com/s4ztz4bnf6-maker/Lubuimi-"
keywords:
  - "Lean 4"
  - "formal verification"
  - "Erdős–Selfridge problem"
  - "covering systems"
  - "square-free moduli"
  - "mathematical software"

